{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111557","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111557/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111557/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111557/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111557","id":3507233909,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6tUJ2E","number":111557,"title":"Improve compile time with `libc++` by defining `_LIBCPP_REMOVE_TRANSITIVE_INCLUDES` in `typedefs.h`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-10-12T13:54:49Z","updated_at":"2025-12-04T08:43:39Z","closed_at":"2025-12-04T03:07:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111557","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111557","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111557.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111557.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Helps address #111218 \r\n\r\nIn a quick test, this improved compile time on macOS from `5m6s` to `4m43s` (~8%).\r\nIt does this by reducing the impact of many of the `<libcpp>/` entries in the include tracker (#111218). For example, `<libcpp>/string` is reduced from 425s to 86s.\r\n\r\n## Explanation\r\n\r\n`libc++` had been created with many transitive includes, which means that including one file often led to implicit inclusion of other files. In recent versions (C++23 and later) they have been working to reduce this. However, they also offer a macro that allows users to disable transitive includes earlier than this (`_LIBCPP_REMOVE_TRANSITIVE_INCLUDES`).\r\nFor more information, see https://libcxx.llvm.org/DesignDocs/HeaderRemovalPolicy.html\r\n\r\nThis change affects platforms using libc++, which most prominently includes Apple platforms and Android.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111557/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":5},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111557/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}